{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中國多地秋色正濃，從西藏自治區西南部森林，到西北太陽能農場，再到東部江西省風景山區，完美秋季為各地景觀帶來斑斕色彩與清新活力。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8501724_(0000-0046)秋染中國：西藏林芝 - 截图1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/644ef4c9b65344a2a0767c18633c5019/snapshots/8f6ca99274ca40b89275f62c92e21df2-00001.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>本集先帶大家看看西藏林芝市波密縣白隅村，藍天與如海雲朵映襯色彩繽紛的秋季森林。</p><p></p><p>這條村莊正努力將文化與旅遊融合。過去兩年，新興旅遊服務為村莊帶來近400萬元人民幣收入，幫助當地村民創造就業機會，為鄉村發展提供新機遇。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8501724_(0000-0046)秋染中國：西藏林芝 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/644ef4c9b65344a2a0767c18633c5019/snapshots/8f6ca99274ca40b89275f62c92e21df2-00006.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T00:19:57.437385+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:37:51.819209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T00:17:41.085599+00:00","content_hash":"bf133bea810cb93dae4ff4eb4be66c32d447a5073e65e874cbaac3045c12d4a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}